-- R2 shape probe: a NOT in a reached Decide's body. yscript's own negation
-- keyword could not be confirmed against a primary source (spec R2), so
-- `l4 yscript` refuses rather than guess a spelling.

ASSUME `the tenant has paid rent` IS A BOOLEAN

@export Whether the tenant is in arrears
DECIDE `the tenant is in arrears` IS
    NOT `the tenant has paid rent`
